#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:80
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid ""
"A powerful graphical interface for managing ASUS ROG, TUF, and ProArt "
"laptops on Linux."
msgstr ""
"Une interface graphique puissante pour gérer les ordinateurs portables ASUS "
"ROG, TUF et ProArt sous Linux."

#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:88
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid ""
"Official GUI for the asusctl toolset — seamless hardware tuning without the "
"command line."
msgstr ""
"Interface graphique officielle de la suite asusctl : un réglage matériel en "
"toute simplicité, sans ligne de commande."

#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:99
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid "Key Features"
msgstr "Caractéristiques principales :"

#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:108
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid "Performance: Switch power profiles and customize fan curves."
msgstr ""
"Performance : changez de profil d'alimentation et personnalisez les courbes "
"de ventilation."

#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:109
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid "Aura Sync: Control keyboard backlighting and LED effects."
msgstr "Aura Sync : contrôlez le rétroéclairage du clavier et les effets LED."

#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:110
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid "Battery Health: Set charge limits to extend battery longevity."
msgstr ""
"Santé de la batterie : définissez des limites de charge pour prolonger la "
"durée de vie de la batterie."

#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:111
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid "Display: Toggle Panel Overdrive and refresh rates."
msgstr ""
"Affichage : activez le Panel Overdrive et modifiez les fréquences de "
"rafraîchissement."

#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:112
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid "AniMe Matrix: Control AniMe Matrix displays."
msgstr "AniMe Matrix : contrôlez les écrans AniMe Matrix."

#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:117
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Configuration requise :"

#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:125
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid ""
"Kernel 6.19+ recommended (latest kernel always preferred). asusctl/asusd "
"daemon required for hardware control."
msgstr ""
"Noyau 6.19 ou supérieur recommandé (le noyau le plus récent est toujours "
"préférable). Le démon asusctl/asusd est requis pour le contrôle matériel."

